{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Grandma Raccoon\u2019s pixel home and help her bring order to everyday chaos. Relax, organize, and take joy in the little things with Raccoon Cocoon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf9\u2728 <i>Cozy puzzles, gentle vibes. That\u2019s the spirit!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/steamworks1.gif?t=1744915681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>What awaits you inside this warm little cocoon?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Organize books, sort drawers, and line up cozy clutter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tidy up cute cacti, flowers, and mushroom collections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy retro-inspired mini games </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying symmetry, pattern-matching, and visual logic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No timers, no stress \u2014 just pure cozy vibes</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/no2.gif?t=1744915681\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc3e Whether you\u2019re emptying boxes or pressing flowers in a book, every puzzle is a quiet little moment with Grandma Raccoon. Put the kettle on and take your time \u2014 she\u2019s in no rush. \ud83c\udf75</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/extras/minigames.gif?t=1744915681\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666490?t=1744915681","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666490/02840dc28fa413629f17ee32e9f781ff014a004b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744915681","capsule_image":"https://sh